    "finalName": "",
    "description": "You can use your <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Use_the_Force\" title=\"Use the Force\">Use the Force</a> check modifier instead of your <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Initiative\" title=\"Initiative\">Initiative</a> modifier when making <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Initiative\" title=\"Initiative\">Initiative</a> checks. You are considered <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Trained\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Trained\">Trained</a> in the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Initiative\" title=\"Initiative\">Initiative</a> skill. If you are entitled to an <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Initiative\" title=\"Initiative\">Initiative</a> check reroll, you may reroll your <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Use_the_Force\" title=\"Use the Force\">Use the Force</a> check instead (subject to the same circumstances and limitations).<br><br>You may use this Talent to determine the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Initiative\" title=\"Initiative\">Initiative</a> of a Starship if you are the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Pilot_(Vehicle_Combat)\" title=\"Pilot (Vehicle Combat)\">Pilot</a>.",
